// FUNCTION: BFME2 0x001DB3FE size=52 name=?findGameMessageMetaType@MetaMap@@IAE?AW4Type@GameMessage@@PBD@Z evidence=N:ledger tier=B hypothesis:K
GameMessage::Type MetaMap::findGameMessageMetaType(const char *name)
{
	for (const MetaTypeEntry *entry = s_metaTypeEntries; entry->name != 0; ++entry) {
		if (_strcmpi(entry->name, name) == 0)
			return entry->type;
	}
	return (GameMessage::Type)0;
}

